<title>JAPAN: BOJ to take appropriate monetary policy-Matsushita.</title>
<headline>BOJ to take appropriate monetary policy-Matsushita.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) will pursue an appropriate monetary policy to ensure a firmer economy, BOJ Governor Yasuo Matsushita told a parliamentary committee on administrative reforms on Friday.</p>
</text>
